      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091448">Move packed integer values in ymm1 to m256 using non-temporal hint.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1091915">EVEX.128.66.0F.W0 E7 /r</para>
      <para unique="1091916">VMOVNTDQ m128, xmm1</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091920">B</para>
